    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "REA Spratt offer for sale this superb 3 bedroom semi detached bungalow enjoying a fabulous location in the popular Comeragh Crescent Development. This property which was constructed at the outset larger than the majority of homes in the Comeragh Crescent Development is presented in turnkey condition. The property has the benefit of both front and rear gardens connected via a gated pedestrian access point. However by reason of the existing width there is potential for vehicular access if so required. The rear garden benefits from a sunny orientation and by reason of the block wall boundaries enjoys good privacy. Significant retro insulation was carried in recent years to include wrapping of the external walls, insulating of attic space and installation of new condenser boiler. The property is adjacent to the N25 Waterford/Cork route with Glaxo Smithkline, Haleon and Eurofins Lancaster Laboratories nearby. This home is within a stroll of Dungarvan Town Centre and all amenities to include restaurants, pubs, numerous sporting facilities, plus the Waterford Greenway and Clonea Beach. The deceptive accommodation extending to 87 sq.m comprises, Entrance Hallway, Livingroom, Kitchen / breakfast room, 3 bedrooms and shower room. External: Block built shed to rea.\n\nREA Spratt highly recommend viewing of this home which is strictly by appointment only 058-42211 \n\nAccommodation\n\nEntrance Hall\n6.00m x 1.50m Tiled floor\n\nSitting Room\n4.60m x 3.80m Timber floor, open fireplace, bay window overlooking front garden\n\nKitchen / Breakfast Area\n4.84m x 3.50m Fitted kitchen units to include washing machine, cooker, fridge freezer. Door to rear garden off\n\nBedroom 1\n3.30m x 3.10m Timber floor\n\nBedroom 2\n3.80m x 3.62m Timber floor\n\nBedroom 3\n3.35m x 3.20m Timber floor\n\nShower Room\n3.30m x 1.80m Floor and walls fully tiled. Walk in shower cubicle, Triton T90sr electric shower. Vanity unit incorporating wash hand basin, access to attic overhead\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Conveniently located bungalow residence within walking distance of Town Centre.\nOff street car parking.\nBlock built shed to rear.\nC1 Energy Rating post upgrading insulation works.\nVacant and early close of sale can be accommodated\nAttic space partially floored\nHigh speed broadband available\nAll floor coverings, all window furnishings, all light fittings and all electrical appliances \n All main services to include mains water and mains sewerage\nOil fired central heating \n All of the amenities of Dungarvan town centre within easy reach."
      },
